# The Reference's Hearing your screen (tools/make_manual.py --renders): screens only. P1 tapped, played, Pitch opened
# with a screen reader listening; the page sends "Pitch page. Drone 1: Pitch D3, Reso 25. Drone 2: Pitch A3, Reso 25."
# (heard as "... resonance 25 ...": firmware/words.tsv)
notips
phones 1
listen
tapkey w0
tap PLAY
wait 9000
tap HOME
wait 1500
said Pitch_page._Drone_1:_Pitch_D3,_Reso_25._Drone_2:_Pitch_A3,_Reso_25.
shot r-reader-0.png
